{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gbyhsbi9","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64,"top":210,"width":1140,"height":380},"text":"Tenant-owned tasks enter a placement engine.\nThree tiers reserve CPU and RAM through simulated VMs.\nA virtual clock processes arrivals and completions.\nOptional queues hold temporarily blocked jobs.\nProtected timelines and decision snapshots explain outcomes.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#163343","alignment":"left"}}
