{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i9gfidcb","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":64,"top":210,"width":580,"height":380},"text":"Same 18 tasks, queues off: both policies complete all tasks.\nMean response: 68.06 ms latency first, 89.17 ms capacity aware.\nPeak Fog CPU: 100% versus 41.67%.\nCapacity aware preserves headroom at a response cost.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#163343","alignment":"left"}}
