{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dkrqtcre","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":64,"top":210,"width":1140,"height":380},"text":"40 tasks per seed, identical for each policy, queues on.\nAverage completions: 32.8 latency, 33.5 capacity, 32.9 energy.\nMean response: 74.30, 89.40 and 72.48 ms respectively.\nModeled energy: 16.232, 21.424 and 16.456 J.\nEnergy aware did not produce the lowest total energy.\nCompare energy alongside completed task counts.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#163343","alignment":"left"}}
